"Exception: Inside an admonition or topic, capture the buffered inline "
"content as the pending title and restore the main output stream. A `.. "
"contents::` topic (D-05) inserts its buffered title as a bold label ahead"
" of its already-streamed bullet_list instead of consuming it as a box "
"title argument. A table caption (TBL-01, Phase 25) captures the buffered "
"`table_cell_content` into `self.table_caption` for `depart_table` to "
"consume, instead of emitting a heading() close."
