#: of typsphinx.translator.TypstTranslator.depart_term:3
msgid ""
"Saves buffered term content. If the term carries a docutils-assigned id "
"(e.g. a `.. glossary::` entry), emits a Typst `<label>` anchor via the "
"bracket-wrap markup form so a same-document `:term:` reference's `link"
"(<term-id>, ...)` (visit_reference's refid branch, D-03) has a resolvable"
" target instead of aborting the compile with \"label does not exist\" "
"(XREF-01, D-04). Mirrors the visit_title/depart_title bracket-wrap anchor"
" pattern (Phase 11) -- never `+`-join a bare `label(...)` onto content, "
"which raises `TypstError: cannot add content and label`."
