#: of typsphinx.translator.TypstTranslator.visit_topic:8
msgid ""
"A `.. contents::` topic (carrying the `contents` class) is instead box-"
"less pass-through (D-05): its title is rendered as a bold label (handled "
"entirely by visit_title/depart_title's insert-index trick) and its child "
"bullet_list renders through the existing, unmodified list visitors -- no "
"clue box wraps it here."
