#: of typsphinx.translator.TypstTranslator.visit_line_block:3
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Only the outermost line_block (depth 0) opens the `par({...})` wrapper --"
" a nested line_block (docutils nests these directly, no intermediate "
"wrapper node) shares the same wrapper as its parent. "
"`self._line_block_depth` is a single integer counter; docutils' own "
"visitor recursion already provides the nesting \"stack\" for free, so no "
"separate stack data structure is needed (see 13-RESEARCH.md \"Don't Hand-"
"Roll\")."
msgstr ""

#: of typsphinx.translator.TypstTranslator.depart_line_block:1
