#: of typsphinx.translator.TypstTranslator.visit_transition:3
msgid ""
"Emits a full-width Typst rule via ``line(length: 100%)`` -- a genuine "
"content gap otherwise, since a bare transition renders nothing today "
"(BLK-01). Self-closing node: no children to descend into, so this always "
"raises SkipNode."
