#: of typsphinx.translator.TypstTranslator.visit_glossary:1
msgid "Visit a glossary node (`.. glossary::` directive wrapper)."
msgstr ""

#: of typsphinx.translator.TypstTranslator.visit_glossary:3
msgid ""
"Transparent pass-through (BLK-04): the wrapped `definition_list` child "
"already renders via `visit_definition_list`, and the term anchor is "
"provided by the `depart_term` fix from Plan 12-02 -- do NOT duplicate "
"that anchor logic here."
msgstr ""

#: of typsphinx.translator.TypstTranslator.visit_glossary:8
msgid ""
"A propagated explicit target (``.. _t:`` before ``.. glossary::``) lands "
"its id on THIS glossary node (distinct from the per-term anchors); anchor"
" it so a same-document link(<id>, ...) resolves. A plain glossary carries"
" no ids -> no-op, byte-unchanged."
msgstr ""

#: of typsphinx.translator.TypstTranslator.depart_glossary:1
msgid "Depart a glossary node (transparent pass-through)."
msgstr ""

