#: of typsphinx.translator.TypstTranslator.depart_field:3
msgid ""
"Emit an inter-field double-space separator (FID-09) when this field has a"
" following sibling, mirroring depart_desc_parameter's \"am I the last "
"sibling\" idiom. The double space is wrapped in BOTH a leading AND a "
"trailing newline so it never juxtaposes with the neighboring strong(...) "
"call on one physical source line -- a leading-only newline is a real "
"Typst \"expected semicolon or line break\" fatal."
