#: of typsphinx.translator.TypstTranslator.visit_field_body:3
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"A field body written inline on its field line (e.g. a confval ``:default:"
" The value of **html_title**``) is COLLAPSED by docutils: its children "
"are inline nodes (Text/strong/literal/reference) DIRECTLY under "
"``field_body``, with no wrapping ``paragraph``. Emitted into the code-"
"mode content block those adjacent expressions juxtapose (``text(\"The "
"value of \")strong({...})``) -- a Typst syntax error (\"expected "
"semicolon or line break\", GATE-02 fatal #8). Activate the shared inline-"
"concat context (bug #5 machinery) so they are ``+`` separated into one "
"content value."
msgstr ""

#: of typsphinx.translator.TypstTranslator.visit_field_body:13
msgid ""
"Only an ALL-inline field body needs this. A block field body (real "
"``paragraph``/list/literal-block children) already emits valid, "
"``\\n\\n``-separated statements via the normal par() path, so it keeps "
"the concat context OFF to avoid a stray ``+`` around a ``par(...)``."
msgstr ""

