#: ../../source/api/index.rst:33
msgid "Template Engine"
msgstr ""

#: of typsphinx.template_engine:1
msgid "Template engine for Typst document generation."
msgstr ""

#: of typsphinx.template_engine:3
msgid ""
"This module implements template loading, parameter mapping, and rendering"
" for Typst documents (Requirement 8)."
msgstr ""

#: of typsphinx.template_engine.RawTypst:1
msgid ""
"Wraps a string that must be emitted into the ``.typ`` output VERBATIM -- "
"no quoting, no escaping -- e.g. a Typst length literal like ``20pt``."
msgstr ""

#: of typsphinx.template_engine.RawTypst:5
msgid ""
"Recognized by ``_format_typst_value()``, whose ``isinstance`` branch is "
"checked BEFORE the ``str`` branch, so a ``RawTypst`` value never re-"
"enters string quoting (the double-formatting trap, CONTEXT.md D-02/D-07)."
" This is the type-safe alternative to pre-rendering a value to a Typst-"
"source string inside ``map_parameters()`` -- a pre-rendered plain ``str``"
" is indistinguishable from any other string once it reaches "
"``_format_typst_value()`` and would be quoted a second time."
msgstr ""

#: of typsphinx.template_engine.resolve_package_for_engine:1
msgid ""
"Decide which ``typst_package`` value a TemplateEngine should be built "
"with."
msgstr ""

#: of typsphinx.template_engine.resolve_package_for_engine:3
msgid ""
"D-01/D-03 routing rule: ``typst_template`` is the primary route. Whenever"
" a custom template is configured it wins outright and the package import "
"is suppressed entirely -- even if ``typst_package`` is ALSO set. Only "
"when no custom template is configured does the package route apply."
msgstr ""

#: of typsphinx.template_engine.resolve_package_for_engine:8
msgid ""
"This is the SINGLE place that decision is made. ``writer.py`` (per-"
"document rendering) and ``builder.py`` (the once-per-build shared "
"template file) must not re-derive it independently: writer/builder "
"disagreeing about package-vs-template routing is precisely the shape of "
"BUG-A, the fatal defect phase 22.2 existed to fix (WR-04)."
msgstr ""

#: of typsphinx.template_engine.resolve_package_for_engine:15
msgid "The configured ``typst_package`` value, if any"
msgstr ""

#: of typsphinx.template_engine.resolve_package_for_engine:17
msgid "The configured ``typst_template`` value, if any"
msgstr ""

